<article class="env-remark" id="3B7669">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/3B7669">Remark <span data-tag="3B7669">6.3.5.8</span>.</a> It follows from Remark <a href="/tag/9BBA18" data-tag="9BBA18">6.3.5.7</a> that if $f^{\ast }: \calX \rightarrow \calY $ is a geometric morphism of $\infty $-topoi and $U \in \calX $ is an object, then the induced diagram </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \xymatrix { \calX \ar [r] \ar [d] &amp;  \calY \ar [d] \\ \calX _{/U} \ar [r] &amp;  \calY _{/ f^{\ast } U } } \]
</div>
  <p> is a pushout square in $\LGeom $. </p>
